{
 "info": {
  "_postman_id": "or-dsar-declared-subject-id-2026-11-25",
  "name": "OpenRegister DSAR Declared Subject Id",
  "description": "GET /api/gdpr/access-export for a subject found only through a declared subject id field (change dsar-finds-records-by-declared-subject-id, task 2.3).\n\nWHAT IT ASSERTS: a schema declaring `subjectIdFields: {learnerId: learnerId}` holds two enrolments of one learner and one of another; the access export for the learner lists exactly those two, each with `subjectFields` naming `learnerId` and no detected entities (an internal uuid is never detected); narrowed to type `learnerId` it still finds both, and under another type it finds none through a declared field (CONTROL).\n\nHermetic: it creates its schema, register and enrolments, and removes them.",
  "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
 },
